<title>UK: Chase Manhattan sets $500 million five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Chase Manhattan sets $500 million five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate</p>
<p>issue was announced by joint lead managers Chase Manhattan</p>
<p>International Ltd and Morgan Stanley &amp; Co International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CHASE MANHATTAN CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     5 BP	PAY DATE    21.MAY.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.914</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    99.914</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
